    "author": "Bigi, D., Gambino, P., and Schacht, S.",
    "title": "A fresh look at the determination of $|V_{cb}|$ from $B \\to D^*\\ell\\bar\\nu$",
    "abstract": "We use recent Belle results on $\\bar{B}^0\\rightarrow D^{*+}l^-\\bar\\nu_l$ decays to extract the CKM element $|V_{cb}|$ with two different but well-founded parameterizations of the form factors. We show that the CLN and BGL parameterizations lead to quite different results for $|V_{cb}|$ and provide a simple explanation of this unexpected behaviour. A long lasting discrepancy between the inclusive and exclusive determinations of $|V_{cb}|$ may have to be thoroughly reconsidered.",
